Tribe (libxray 0014, on top of the engine patch 0012): host limits. The host's own probe pools in its host
options ({"platform_limits": {max_full, max_leg, max_awg, max_instances, can_verify_composite, needs_vpn,
platform}}) replace the platform's compiled ones per message, so one engine build serves the iOS tunnel
extension (one probe instance, about 50 MB in all) and the iOS app process (several full-profile probes at once,
composites). Host options are written by the host only; the app's request cannot raise a pool. Module-agnostic
(tribescan/ only), like 0012. Gate: TestTribeScanHostLimits (-tags tribescan_testkit).

